== Effects ==
* Causes a {{R|Treasure Room}} and {{R|Shop}} to generate in {{s|Cathedral}}.

== Notes ==
* Cannot appear in [[Greed Mode]].
* The spawned Treasure Room will have one of 23 unique layouts for the floor.
* {{i|Card Reading}} will spawn a second portal if Isaac has the trinket upon entering Cathedral.

== Synergies ==
* {{A|Golden Trinket|r+}} / {{I|Mom's Box|r+}}: Treasure rooms in the Cathedral have an item choice, as if Isaac had {{i|More Options}} and Shops will be upgraded. Having both reveals the locations of the treasure room and the shop on the map.

== Trivia ==
* This trinket has a demonic counterpart in {{T|Wicked Crown}}.

